WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.006 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:07.006 --> 00:00:09.842
-[ As Trump ]
Thank me. Thank me.

00:00:09.842 --> 00:00:12.611
Thank me very much
for tuning in.

00:00:12.611 --> 00:00:15.281
Welcome to
"Impeachment After Dark Live,"

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:18.651
The only show that recaps the
very mean, very nasty things

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:21.354
Democrats said about me
at today's impeachment hearings.

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:22.488
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:23.722
And before we
go any further,

00:00:23.722 --> 00:00:26.126
yes, I got this aftershow
idea from Andy Cohen --

00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:28.428
or as I call him,
"Opposite Mike Pence."

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:31.163
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.163 --> 00:00:32.999
Now, I admit, folks,
I thought this whole

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:34.800
impeachment thing
would go away by now,

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.102
like a common cold,
or a second wife.

00:00:37.102 --> 00:00:38.738
But yet, here we are.

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:40.673
And worse, now you can't even
get the truth

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:42.908
from shows like
"Fox and Frenemies."

00:00:42.908 --> 00:00:46.412
Even though I am totally
innocent, and legally handsome,

00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:49.215
I have to take matters
into my own huge hands.

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:50.650
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.051
And I'll be honest,
today's hearings

00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:53.519
had me on
the edge of my seat,

00:00:53.519 --> 00:00:56.089
like when Rudy Giuliani
goes on "Fox News,"

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:58.124
or when Stephen Miller
texts me "kk."

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.225
Stop right there,
Stephen.

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:02.328
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:03.562
But let's just
jump into it.

00:01:03.562 --> 00:01:05.564
The impeachment hearings began
this afternoon.

00:01:05.564 --> 00:01:07.066
And just as I suspected,

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:09.202
it started out
totally full of Schiff.

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:11.971
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:14.273
At first, I wasn't going --
It wasn't going so well for me.

00:01:14.273 --> 00:01:15.642
Take a look
at what Kent said.

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:18.278
-Over the course
of 2018 and 2019,

00:01:18.278 --> 00:01:21.447
I became increasingly aware
of an effort by Rudy Giuliani

00:01:21.447 --> 00:01:23.683
and others to smear
Ambassador Yovanovitch

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:26.819
and other officials
at the U.S. Embassy in Kyiv.

00:01:26.819 --> 00:01:27.954
-Really, folks?

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:29.588
You're gonna take
foreign policy advice

00:01:29.588 --> 00:01:31.024
from
Orville Impeachmentbacher?

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:33.392
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.392 --> 00:01:35.461
Anyway, then,
Ambassador Taylor's testimony

00:01:35.461 --> 00:01:38.698
was even harsher on me --
very nasty.

00:01:38.698 --> 00:01:40.833
But eventually,
he came around to my side.

00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:43.269
-President Trump's actions
were clearly correct.

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:46.406
And he is also very, very --
-Handsome.

00:01:46.406 --> 00:01:48.708
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:52.078
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:57.950
-There you have it, folks.
Trump's here to stay.

00:01:57.950 --> 00:01:59.519
I'll be president
for four more years.

00:01:59.519 --> 00:02:01.688
Then, I'll do eight years
as Kanye's V.P.

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:03.021
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.021 --> 00:02:04.824
And then, I'll finally harden
into a ball of hairspray,

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:06.992
and get laid to rest
on a Florida golf course.

00:02:06.992 --> 00:02:08.460
It's the American dream, folks.

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:09.896
[ Coughs ]

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:10.896
I need some water.

00:02:10.896 --> 00:02:11.930
Where's my assistant?

00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:13.165
Where's my new assistant?

00:02:13.165 --> 00:02:14.300
Thank you.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.068
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:16.068 --> 00:02:18.838
Water. Water.

00:02:18.838 --> 00:02:21.006
No. No.

00:02:21.006 --> 00:02:22.007
No. Water.

00:02:22.007 --> 00:02:23.176
Thank you. Yes.

00:02:23.176 --> 00:02:25.010
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:27.647
So, in summary, if you're still
wondering if I'm guilty,

00:02:27.647 --> 00:02:29.648
all I have to say is,
read the transcript.

00:02:29.648 --> 00:02:31.117
-Read the transcript.

00:02:31.117 --> 00:02:32.451
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:32.451 --> 00:02:34.253
-Now, I have to go meet
with the Turkish president,

00:02:34.253 --> 00:02:35.621
President Hair Dragon.

00:02:35.621 --> 00:02:37.924
-It's-- It's--
It's Erdogan.

00:02:37.924 --> 00:02:39.359
-Err-duh-Gone.
-Yep, sure.

00:02:39.359 --> 00:02:40.392
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.392 --> 00:02:41.861
-He's the president
of Turkey, folks,

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:44.297
so I have to do it fast, before
he's eaten on Thanksgiving.

00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:46.165
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.165 --> 00:02:48.400
And there's one more --
There's one more thing.

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:50.102
-Just close the show.
-Oh, that's right.

00:02:50.102 --> 00:02:51.837
[ Normal voice ]
"The Tonight Show" is coming
to you from New York City.

00:02:51.837 --> 00:02:52.872
It's happening right now.

00:02:52.872 --> 00:02:54.874
let's start the show, everybody!
Let's go!

